"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1940044</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ServiceWorkerContainer/register\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ServiceWorkerContainer.register()</code></a> - TrustedScriptURL\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note these ones for 137</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504</a> onmessage and onreadystatechange attributes - not sure what this means. Asking in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1944504#c8</a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> BCD</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Docs</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 138</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1942306</a> <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Content-Security-Policy/trusted-types\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Content-Security-Policy: trusted-types</code></a> - support for setting the allowed trusted type policy names\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> BCD <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3408790407\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27836\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27836\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27836</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Docs - Already OK</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These for 144</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1928932</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Other</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Check content